codex
Ke hoach cuoi cung:
1. Ghi 1 `finding_reviews[]` cho `HR-FP-007__p02` voi `assessment: field_fix`, vi packet-local evidence ung ho FP nhung worker dang noi qua tong quat va bo mo boundary auth.
2. Trong `reason` va `counter_evidence`, toi se tra loi ro 5 cau hoi: route `/contact` reachable qua `ReachRoutes.php`, auth la `__return_true` o route nhung bi chan boi `wp_rest` nonce + connection check trong handler, dataflow ket thuc o return/REST response thay vi HTML sink, va impact XSS khong duoc packet-local chung minh.
3. Toi se ghi ro 1 `expansion_attempts[]` cho `src/Api/Routes/ReachRoutes.php`, them `missing_evidence[]` cho terminal browser sink con thieu, sau do validate JSON syntax truoc khi ket thuc.
codex
Toi dang ghi file output. JSON se giu packet id goc, them `expansion_attempts` cho `ReachRoutes.php`, va ha muc do khang dinh tu “generic REST JSON” xuong “packet-local non-sink/guard logic” de artifact sau vong nay evidence-bound hon.
